cient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299019 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "092fa83e-e3f3-5058-a9d8-481437409870" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+9z=0 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299021} {:answer/id #uuid "ee19f0f7-49fc-544b-b435-b111bf8cad46" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y-9z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=1 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299022} {:answer/id #uuid "8031a972-4167-5cef-94a8-7c1d0da6398b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x+4y=9 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x+4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299023} {:answer/id #uuid "8c4529d5-1d65-5ba4-94e3-fa0d58339aa5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299024} {:answer/id #uuid "5ab98020-afde-5e1e-9d1e-37a213c7779c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299025}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ab98020-afde-5e1e-9d1e-37a213c7779c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299025} :answer-field/id #uuid "8bec9686-7dd8-5c83-baf8-f64e89f4afcb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299020}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "96962965-f338-5825-be42-329eb84d06e9" :question/math-academy-id "q-129132" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 0 & 9 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+0z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299026 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c15fedfb-c4f6-5199-bf46-5676a7e1e515" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & 6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299028} {:answer/id #uuid "79bd8f62-3e7a-5711-b2c9-3f1424ac97cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -7 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299029} {:answer/id #uuid "334a9ce8-6d22-5222-a930-8f31a2ea91f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & -5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299030} {:answer/id #uuid "1581bfba-e9ab-5cf8-826a-5df774e1d628" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299031} {:answer/id #uuid "cc9472f2-fe7e-594a-85c5-0ee1e26260de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & 0 & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1581bfba-e9ab-5cf8-826a-5df774e1d628" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299031} :answer-field/id #uuid "b01c8f97-dcb5-51d3-b8b2-89527f5adeb1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299027}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "c3026f39-025c-5a7c-a464-dd0bc4a5fcca" :question/math-academy-id "q-129144" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a=6b \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b+\\frac{3}{2}=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b=0 \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299033 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ad6b16f6-fabe-5c64-9487-e19a835fd264" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & -1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299035} {:answer/id #uuid "31b6ac7f-a2d5-5035-b6a2-c35c556ba028" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299036} {:answer/id #uuid "651ecc03-005f-596e-bf7a-4c50f026c474" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299037} {:answer/id #uuid "f2422e5e-b8f2-5124-b3d6-5aa6f6847ba4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299038} {:answer/id #uuid "46626434-d94e-5d04-997b-8c9f87f89602" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -6 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299039}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "651ecc03-005f-596e-bf7a-4c50f026c474" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299037} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c082059-7194-56cc-89c9-d93733d9028e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299034}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "50c13fef-606e-554c-99aa-f0c3b91e55d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-129146" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0=4n-8 \\\\ n=-6m+\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $m,n$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0m-4n=-8 \\\\ 6m+n=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299040 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b456d8ef-2511-55b8-83d2-ffc03b55033d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299042} {:answer/id #uuid "3a1d2fd0-e498-589d-b86d-17bbe91dd8d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299043} {:answer/id #uuid "067a9051-8bfd-5418-b983-993268e22183" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218629