iable has a coefficient. \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299061 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8da06a57-cbca-511c-a748-d7ac0b0309a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299063} {:answer/id #uuid "5aeef8a8-a92e-5354-8433-646beba43686" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x-2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299064} {:answer/id #uuid "189ccb97-c626-578d-b23e-bf2c53b9a1fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299065} {:answer/id #uuid "1621e459-3620-5800-bc3a-5c40754f3810" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299066} {:answer/id #uuid "594ce130-19c0-5d06-a4b3-29543169dcca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+3z=-2 \\\\ x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299067}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "189ccb97-c626-578d-b23e-bf2c53b9a1fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299065} :answer-field/id #uuid "5fd5ea2c-c78a-598b-9ced-98631ce35101" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299062}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b5cb76d6-8596-56c0-bf91-5764390c6dbb" :question/math-academy-id "q-20362" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299068 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f972d7c0-4634-51b5-af32-afe1f1999d5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299070} {:answer/id #uuid "901d1847-7de6-56e8-a4aa-345011376616" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y-3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299071} {:answer/id #uuid "319b04da-13f5-5b0a-9878-0f25442b35d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299072} {:answer/id #uuid "376dcf78-9ec1-53d4-8aea-40c9c79889b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x-3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299073} {:answer/id #uuid "d0c85029-34f6-538c-b67e-00a4822f2585" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ x-3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299074}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f972d7c0-4634-51b5-af32-afe1f1999d5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299070} :answer-field/id #uuid "867fa580-cbc4-57ee-9dc1-f59e9b1260da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299069}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cea724ab-eefd-5881-88ee-d57f97e33a19" :question/math-academy-id "q-20363" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+0y+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y+0z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain: \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ 2x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299075 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b7f04e5-bb59-561d-bc33-986c3b052a70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299077} {:answer/id #uuid "324561b1-b319-50e2-aee3-b397b952fc90" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299078} {:answer/id #uuid "9e2fe635-ebe1-5d3b-b988-69a1a193b93f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299079} {:answer/id #uuid "ce41cd04-b9de-5e3d-9e72-e963a727dcb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299080} {:answer/id #uuid "655ec5ab-ad2f-5e5f-bc7d-e5a8270e0146" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299081}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce41cd04-b9de-5e3d-9e72-e963a727dcb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299080} :answer-field/id #uuid "abc3b43a-f9bf-5ccf-b75b-130587def462" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299076}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e3639f99-8a66-5dbf-93d1-a38d266959d9" :question/math-academy-id "q-71712" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2y=1 \\\\ 3x=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered  $x,y$ \n on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x-2y=1 \\\\ 3x+0y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299082 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c710ee9-9e38-5d2d-ac9d-9b85eef825a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299084} {:answer/id #uuid "65384ad5-86ff-5cf3-b088-36c5b084aab7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & 9\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299085} {:answer/id #uuid "b7ec489f-efe6-5bdf-8cea-e6f83a4247e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8 & 9\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299086} {:answer/id #uuid "f228aeac-7982-5585-9bdb-c3508dfaed17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 & -6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & -9\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299087} {:answer/id #uuid "ef04cf0a-366d-5a5e-a4bf-d8365cc4e560" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 2 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 8\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299088}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5c710ee9-9e38-5d2d-ac9d-9b85eef825a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299084} :answer-field/id #uuid "5ccd9ff1-21eb-554f-84e5-fa5fa609f773" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299083}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "d20ee063-aad5-5075-b98d-a0c07cad0649" :question/math-academy-id "q-71714" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+2y=3 \\\\ -4y+5z=6 \\\\ 7x+8z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+2y+0z=3 \\\\ 0x-4y+5z=6 \\\\ 7x+0y+8z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299089 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c5b80452-12b9-5ea6-89d8-e660225e9277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299091} {:answer/id #uuid "e33c94ee-d059-5f9f-b841-d2d8cb9947c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299092} {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} {:answer/id #uuid "f3efe0ef-e145-5648-a1ca-631fbb55b726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299094} {:answer/id #uuid "a2e5a4cf-c626-571e-9739-342e8312b273" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299095}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} :answer-field/id #uuid "c0aaedcf-8f9e-55a6-ad72-25a43e5ddd91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299090}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "671bb0ea-172d-5bcd-9af7-fde2cdb49f9b" :question/math-academy-id "q-71722" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-3=2y \\\\ 1+y=-2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=3 \\\\ 2x+y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060322 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1003d7e-42ef-59a2-9038-178e1c676be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 10; - x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058916} {:answer/id #uuid "c4ded7fa-c1f6-5aad-8a94-f332f052ff6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 0; - x + y = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058917} {:answer/id #uuid "e51ccf34-2862-5dcc-bb64-f8f734bc2e82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x + 2y = 10; x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058918} {:answer/id #uuid "eac00324-c2df-502b-b5dd-ba0a44acfb6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x + 2y = 1; - x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058919} {:answer/id #uuid "038c96de-d924-5dda-835b-036092e680cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 10; x + y = 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058920}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1003d7e-42ef-59a2-9038-178e1c676be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x - 2y = 10; - x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058916} :answer-field/id #uuid "f473abb5-e351-5444-b66f-186a774f8f2c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058915}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "611f1d4a-3c30-50c6-9215-73810a99de02" :question/math-academy-id "q-71724" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299096 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd07f452-0633-5460-9442-d326bf925eb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-18\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299098} {:answer/id #uuid "35795abf-e7a2-5919-b638-5fc6256411e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-5x-y=10 \\\\ -3x-2y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299099} {:answer/id #uuid "10e6f7b9-0cdd-5b87-a45d-70e89c39842b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=1 \\\\ -2x-3y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299100} {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} {:answer/id #uuid "41578edf-3c23-5b5f-982a-492b8f89b9f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-16\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} :answer-field/id #uuid "36b93888-4be1-504b-b8c2-f8ea03f231ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299097}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fccffcb6-cabb-5be9-bcba-30754f9d0e4e" :question/math-academy-id "q-71728" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -15\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299103 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e35c8f0c-a7f5-5565-922b-fb17c30a5cd2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299105} {:answer/id #uuid "651fee39-5130-508b-a1e9-34741f00649b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299106} {:answer/id #uuid "96bd09a1-b4b0-57fc-9cab-85c2467937ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299107} {:answer/id #uuid "0a3f3600-9316-5dc5-99a9-de44153fb00c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299108} {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3249609-b27f-5fe9-bb12-dc6539b4d474" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299104}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39cd7b44-484f-5137-a0a3-95f76a9d1baa" :question/math-academy-id "q-71733" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}]}
